{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the candidates and select the best 20 for this Java backend engineering interest.\n\nLet me review the candidates. The interest is: \"Java 后端工程，关注数据库、并发和服务故障处理的实现与原理，不关注培训招生、证书宣传或求职薪资榜单。\" (Java backend engineering, focusing on databases, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles, NOT interested in training enrollment, certificate promotion, or job salary rankings.)\n\nThe candidates have titles combining a topic (事务传播/transaction propagation, 缓存失效/cache invalidation, 任务取消/task cancellation, 线程池排队/thread pool queueing, 连接池等待/connection pool waiting, 接口幂等/API idempotency, 并发更新/concurrent update, 慢查询/slow query, 组合索引/composite index, 消息重复/message duplication) with a content type (概念速览/concept overview, 条件与原理/conditions and principles, 操作记录/operation records, 专题观察/topic observation, 市场观察/market observation).\n\nThe \"市场观察\" (market observation) type explicitly covers 培训招生价格、证书推广和薪资排名 (training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings) — which the user explicitly does NOT want. So I should exclude all \"市场观察\" candidates.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" (topic observation) type covers 技术社区活动、软件发展沿革与开发者访谈 (tech community activities, software development history, developer interviews) — this is more about industry culture/community, not directly about database/concurrency/fault handling implementation. These are less relevant to the user's focus on implementation and principles.\n\nThe most relevant content types for the user's interest (implementation and principles of databases, concurrency, fault handling) are:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - explains state changes, concurrency ordering, resource boundaries, conditions for solutions\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - minimal reproduction scenarios, key logs, locating waits and data changes, verification steps\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - lists common concepts, provides problem catalog\n\nLet me identify the candidates that are NOT market observation and NOT topic observation (which are less relevant). Actually, let me reconsider. The user wants implementation and principles. The best matches are 条件与原理 and 操作记录. 概念速览 is a concept overview which is also relevant as an entry point.\n\nLet me count the relevant candidates. I need to select 20.\n\nLet me categorize all candidates by their content type suffix:\n\nMarket observation (市场观察) - EXCLUDE (training/cert/salary content):\n- item-0ac50d9f7f27 (线程池排队：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-0af1c4827cd8 (连接池等待：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n- item-0be6197962c6 (接口幂等：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-10482516c15c (缓存失效：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-1178ddd58b15 (并发更新：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-1a7442187146 (线程池排队：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n- item-1c3f785dd079 (任务取消：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3356f301eff1 (事务传播：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-34481c910531 (连接池等待：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3b9f2dc9469c (事务传播：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3cca11fe4770 (并发更新：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3dd8795cff7b (组合索引：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-4780c84a7983 (消息重复：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-50c1d851bc3e (连接池等待：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-5844dd71f1b0 (任务取消：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-5fcb0644cc52 (接口幂等：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-636d70dcfcba (接口幂等：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n\nTopic observation (专题观察) - these cover community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture. Less aligned with implementation/principles focus. Lower priority.\n\nLet me focus on the strongest candidates: 条件与原理 and 操作记录 types, which directly address implementation and principles.\n\nLet me list all 条件与原理 candidates:\n- item-07ad7c7c66a5 (任务取消：内容管理接口中的条件与原理)\n- item-167782abe824 (事务传播：内容管理接口中的条件与原理)\n- item-17c3bb0307b5 (并发更新：后台处理任务中的条件与原理)\n- item-20bfb5d44845 (连接池等待：消息消费者中的条件与原理)\n- item-31156631e3f2 (接口幂等：社区服务中的条件与原理)\n- item-3494031e73f0 (接口幂等：后台处理任务中的条件与原理)\n- item-3a036e513cc4 (消息重复：消息消费者中的条件与原理)\n- item-3b6e33dce189 (事务传播：社区服务中的条件与原理)\n- item-484f44814a6c (连接池等待：内容管理接口中的条件与原理)\n- item-48bbae8e6847 (接口幂等：内容管理接口中的条件与原理)\n- item-493d69ea1678 (事务传播：消息消费者中的条件与原理)\n- item-499e6590050c (组合索引：内容管理接口中的条件与原理)\n- item-501f16